            CNet Amiga Who, v2.61 by Dotoran of Frontiers BBS!
============================================================================
    If you're using this mod for the first time, please refer to the other
text file, titled "WHO_README!" for instructions on installing and using
this mod on your bbs.

    If you're using v2.60(or v2.51), and want to UPGRADE to 2.61, follow
these steps:

    Copy the CONFIG, LOADER, MAKEWHO, SHORT, NORMAL, and LONG command files
OVER the existing ones in your system. These command files had changes made
to them which allows them to run on v4.11 (or v3.05c thru v3.99) CNet, but
note that these files will NOT, repeat NOT run on a version of CNet Amiga
between v4.00 and 4.10, as these versions use the hexadecimal mailbox names,
which this version does NOT support.

    Another change made to these files was a slight modification, so that
the file will "KNOW WHERE IT WAS LOADED FROM", which means you can store
the "Who/" directory anywhere you wish, and they'll know where to find the
other files they may be looking for.

    Do NOT copy the CONFIG.DATA, IDLEPORTS, _BANNERS, _GLIMPSE, or _HISTORY
files, unless you which to overwrite any custom settings you may have made
to one or more of these in the past.

    Lastly, replace the WHO_README! and WHO_HISTORY! files with the updated
versions found in this archive.

    That's It! Enjoy!
